{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S06、S07、S12等处加入了“怕自己要得太多”“隐隐紧张”“让对方安心”等原叙事没有明确说出的心理判断，个别地方解释得稍满，准确性不如Y克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把关键心理动作和因果转折加亮，观众不用逐字读完就能抓住每段叙事的骨架；感受词又按音乐进程分时出现，避免像Y那样需要从一堆同时呈现的短词中自行筛选。更重要的是，X的感受不只停留在烟花、悲伤、快乐等情绪标签，而是延伸到呼吸、身体重心、音色、声线、时间感和具体意象，使情绪变化有层次、有触感。Y的叙事文字本身完整流畅，但重点不够醒目，右侧感受词与具体心理转折的对应也不够紧密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7afb21ff-b2ac-43b7-9f26-1929ec37cc22", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T062611451019Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:27:21.226223+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "88d982d7451e4d222ebbde2d82943f1a1a1049352267ff06f5ade2187a8024b5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f